# React

- Functional components only; named exports — no `React.FC`, no default exports for app components
- Next.js: Server Components by default; `"use client"` only when required
- Tailwind via `cn` (`clsx` + `twMerge`) — see styling rule; no string-ternary `className`s
- Semantic HTML + a11y (names, keyboard, labels) — see accessibility rule
- No inline display strings — locales or constants (project chooses); see i18n rule
- Escalate shared interactive logic into hooks; `useEffect` uses a named inner function

Details: `docs/frontend/tools/REACT.md`, `docs/frontend/conventions/ENGINEERING.md`
